WEBVTT

00:11.560 --> 00:12.960
What's wrong, Roa?

00:12.960 --> 00:15.470
Is that the best the Beast 
King's daughter can do?

00:16.500 --> 00:18.630
You...

00:18.630 --> 00:22.200
I won't accept you as my master!

00:22.480 --> 00:26.610
Uh, I never said I was gonna be your master...

00:27.600 --> 00:29.920
Even if you're the hero who saved the world!

00:29.920 --> 00:32.160
Even if my dad accepted you!

00:32.160 --> 00:35.130
You won't ever be my master, 
unless you beat me!

00:36.500 --> 00:38.140
Yeah, yeah.

00:40.960 --> 00:45.100
Bring it on, then. Dueling is the 
way of life for the Beastmen, right?

00:48.110 --> 00:50.680
What, you're not gonna make a move?

00:50.680 --> 00:52.970
O-Of course I will!

00:53.410 --> 00:56.110
I'll wipe that smug look off your face!

00:59.160 --> 01:03.000
Take this!

00:59.990 --> 01:03.000
Good. You've got guts!

02:36.420 --> 02:41.010
<b><i>Episode 8</i></b>

02:36.420 --> 02:41.010
<b><i>Fighting a Duel for a Second Time</i></b>

02:41.340 --> 02:46.020
<b>Regdom, Royal Capital</b>

02:46.310 --> 02:51.020
And why should we wait to be invaded?!

02:51.500 --> 02:55.440
We should simply overpower 
both the demons and the humans!

02:56.880 --> 02:59.820
That's what I mean when 
I say you're being thoughtless!

03:00.110 --> 03:03.360
Yes! We must first think 
about protecting our people.

03:03.360 --> 03:05.080
That is where the pride of the Beastmen is!

03:05.080 --> 03:09.790
Silence, cowards! There is no 
pride in such spinelessness!

03:10.140 --> 03:12.250
How dare you?!

03:12.590 --> 03:15.060
Even if we were to fight, 
we must prepare first!

03:15.060 --> 03:18.320
If they attack us first, it'll be too late!

03:18.320 --> 03:20.670
Who are you to speak of pride?

03:20.670 --> 03:23.840
Don't you have any trust in our forces?

03:23.840 --> 03:24.610
Roa.

03:23.840 --> 03:28.270
We should simply strike first 
and thwart their advance!

03:25.060 --> 03:26.760
Yes, Dad?

03:30.270 --> 03:31.770
Be right back!

03:31.770 --> 03:34.990
Then we shall settle this with our fists!

03:33.410 --> 03:36.210
Who could ever agree to your scheme?!

03:34.990 --> 03:37.190
My thoughts exactly. A duel!

03:51.080 --> 03:54.270
Like I said, I know Regulus!

03:54.270 --> 03:56.590
I'm here on important business!

03:56.590 --> 04:01.530
How can we trust a human who calls our 
king by his first name during wartime?

04:01.530 --> 04:04.110
We'll let you walk away. Now leave!

04:04.110 --> 04:06.010
He is our master.

04:06.010 --> 04:08.300
Please let us through!

04:08.870 --> 04:12.890
N-Not that he's actually accepted us yet, 
so we're just candidates for now, but...

04:13.150 --> 04:14.780
Who are you?

04:14.780 --> 04:17.900
What does it matter if 
he's your master? Go away!

04:17.900 --> 04:19.780
That didn't work at all.

04:20.080 --> 04:24.780
Aw... I thought we were 
getting pretty famous.

04:25.090 --> 04:30.480
Ugh, what a pain in the ass! Maybe I'll just 
leap in from here like the last time...

04:33.510 --> 04:38.340
Setsu!

04:48.470 --> 04:49.510
Setsu!

04:50.960 --> 04:55.520
This scent, this presence...
Your appearance is a bit different,

04:55.520 --> 04:57.520
but it must be you, Setsu!

04:57.520 --> 05:00.550
Yeah, you haven't changed, Roa.

05:01.840 --> 05:04.600
Roa, the Beast King's daughter?!

05:05.100 --> 05:06.880
Roa Leonaire-sama?!

05:07.710 --> 05:10.370
I missed you, Setsu!

05:17.730 --> 05:19.990
You're so strong, as always!

05:19.990 --> 05:22.800
I didn't expect any less 
from my future master!

05:23.220 --> 05:26.050
Like I said, I'm not going 
to become your master.

05:26.550 --> 05:30.150
What's wrong? Are you being shy 
because it's been so long?

05:30.150 --> 05:31.060
No!

05:31.770 --> 05:35.310
Is she really the Beast King's daughter?

05:36.150 --> 05:37.310
Yes.

05:37.900 --> 05:42.230
I heard you vanished after the peace 
treaty signing, so I was worried.

05:42.710 --> 05:46.490
What took you so long? If you're back, 
you should have come straight to me!

05:46.490 --> 05:50.240
Sorry about that. A lot happened.

05:55.790 --> 05:59.300
P-Please, you two! We're in public!

05:59.300 --> 06:01.090
I'm jealous.

06:01.560 --> 06:04.250
Nothing changed over the last five years.

06:04.670 --> 06:06.220
Setsu!

06:06.220 --> 06:08.640
I missed you, Setsu!

06:08.640 --> 06:11.640
Regulus!

06:16.560 --> 06:19.350
Strong as always, Setsu!

06:19.350 --> 06:23.110
I expected nothing less from
the hero who fought by my side!

06:23.110 --> 06:26.360
I keep telling you, I'm no hero!

06:26.620 --> 06:29.260
We just saw this moments ago, didn't we?

06:33.680 --> 06:36.620
Seems you haven't changed, either.

06:37.030 --> 06:42.130
Speaking of change, Setsu, 
you look very different.

06:45.260 --> 06:47.630
But this scent... This presence!

06:47.880 --> 06:49.460
You're definitely Setsu.

06:49.460 --> 06:50.380
It's Setsu!

06:50.380 --> 06:51.390
No kidding!

06:52.980 --> 06:56.270
It's great to see that Setsu is back!

06:56.530 --> 06:58.270
We must hold a feast!

06:58.560 --> 07:02.250
Wait, no. Only fists can 
communicate this feeling.

07:02.250 --> 07:03.770
Let us fight a duel!

07:03.770 --> 07:06.020
A party before the feast!

07:06.610 --> 07:08.770
That sounds like fun,

07:08.770 --> 07:11.890
but I actually have some pretty 
urgent business to discuss.

07:13.950 --> 07:18.400
About the war taking place between 
the humans and the demons?

07:18.400 --> 07:20.940
Yeah. Toma is alive.

07:21.580 --> 07:25.500
He's behind all of this and 
plotting to kill everyone.

07:26.320 --> 07:32.670
I can't sit idly by after hearing that, 
nor can my nation of Zoo Dorado.

07:34.010 --> 07:35.050
No.

07:35.390 --> 07:39.030
Toma might try to start something here, too.

07:39.030 --> 07:39.910
Yes.

07:40.550 --> 07:44.690
It would be best if Regulus could 
stay here and provide backup.

07:47.990 --> 07:51.450
I guess I have to go instead of my dad, huh?

07:51.450 --> 07:52.990
Right, Dad?

07:53.930 --> 07:59.660
Indeed, Roa is the best replacement for 
me in terms of both ability and rank...

07:59.660 --> 08:02.370
But I still think I should be the one to—

08:02.370 --> 08:04.750
Please wait, my king!

08:06.760 --> 08:10.960
Both humans and demons 
are our natural enemies.

08:12.000 --> 08:14.380
Given that our nation is at risk as well,

08:14.380 --> 08:17.390
there is no way we can spare any 
manpower for the other nations!

08:17.920 --> 08:18.680
Who's this?

08:20.730 --> 08:23.640
I am Rouga, Commander of 
the Zoo Dorado Army, and...

08:24.040 --> 08:26.020
fiancé of Roa-san!

08:29.220 --> 08:31.670
Rouga does have a point,

08:31.670 --> 08:34.740
but this is Setsu the Hero, my comrade.

08:35.260 --> 08:39.720
The same "hero" who has been 
missing for five whole years!

08:39.720 --> 08:43.500
How can we know for certain 
that he is still on our side?

08:48.250 --> 08:50.010
Don't be an idiot!

08:50.010 --> 08:52.970
Of course Setsu can be trusted!

08:52.970 --> 08:55.720
He's my future master, after all!

08:56.080 --> 08:59.520
But he left you for five whole years!

08:59.520 --> 09:03.430
Just because he decided to come back 
doesn't mean we can just give you up now!

09:06.890 --> 09:08.850
Both sides have a point.

09:08.850 --> 09:13.440
So, what do we Beastmen do to 
determine whose opinion to go with?

09:15.890 --> 09:17.380
Setsu the Hero!

09:17.380 --> 09:21.050
On my pride as a Beastman,
I challenge you to a duel!

09:23.450 --> 09:28.460
Yes! I, Beast King Regulus, 
will officiate this duel!

09:28.460 --> 09:31.460
The winner shall be betrothed to Roa!

09:39.470 --> 09:43.660
Uh, this was never about 
anyone marrying Roa...

09:43.660 --> 09:47.430
I'll be waiting for you at 
the arena, noon tomorrow.

09:47.430 --> 09:49.330
Prepare yourself for your demise.

09:52.430 --> 09:54.440
Good luck!

09:56.580 --> 10:02.560
Sorry, Setsu. Beastmen are hard 
to convince any other way.

10:02.560 --> 10:05.500
You just had to go and make 
this even more annoying.

10:05.500 --> 10:09.790
That said, we Beastmen 
are easy to understand.

10:09.790 --> 10:14.380
You win the duel, you get your military 
support <i>and</i> Roa. Two birds with one stone.

10:14.380 --> 10:17.940
Setsu is the only master for me.

10:17.940 --> 10:21.000
Please help me convince Rouga.

10:21.000 --> 10:23.350
Ugh, fine.

10:23.810 --> 10:26.930
When all's said and done, 
you're such a nice guy, Setsu.

10:26.930 --> 10:31.280
We also have a reservation 
to make Setsu our master...

10:31.280 --> 10:33.110
Huh? M-Me, too?

10:33.560 --> 10:36.780
Let's not complicate matters further, okay?

10:45.450 --> 10:47.580
Rouga, you got a moment?

10:48.670 --> 10:49.920
Roa-san.

10:50.320 --> 10:55.280
I'll be straight with you.
Setsu is on a whole other level.

10:55.280 --> 10:56.750
You don't stand a chance.

10:58.270 --> 11:00.690
I'm a warrior myself.

11:00.690 --> 11:04.850
I don't have to fight Setsu the Hero 
to know the difference in our abilities.

11:05.580 --> 11:06.350
But...

11:07.400 --> 11:10.850
As a Beastman, and as a man,
there are times when I can't back down.

11:11.420 --> 11:12.560
Rouga...

11:13.440 --> 11:16.030
Besides, I do have some chance of winning.

11:18.020 --> 11:21.090
An Eastern mage gave this to me.

11:21.090 --> 11:24.370
It's a magic rune that converts 
strong will into strength.

11:24.640 --> 11:25.990
A magic rune?

11:27.860 --> 11:31.120
Perhaps the Beast King would tell me 
I shouldn't rely on these things,

11:31.810 --> 11:34.930
but if that's what it takes to protect you,

11:34.930 --> 11:39.180
I won't hesitate to sacrifice 
my life or my pride.

11:50.580 --> 11:54.310
Even at a time like this, 
you won't look at me.

11:57.440 --> 12:01.900
That's the reason why I never fell for you.

12:05.430 --> 12:06.940
Get him, Rouga!

12:06.940 --> 12:10.300
Show that human what the 
Commander of Zoo Dorado can do!

12:10.300 --> 12:11.370
Go, go!

12:11.370 --> 12:13.840
Don't let him beat you, Setsu!

12:13.840 --> 12:16.290
Setsu-san! Good luck!

12:18.980 --> 12:23.010
<b>Arena within Regdom, Royal Capital</b>

12:23.010 --> 12:26.800
Whoa, this turned into a whole thing...

12:26.800 --> 12:29.280
We Beastmen do love festivals.

12:29.280 --> 12:32.010
Go knock him out, future master!

12:32.010 --> 12:34.530
Ow! What was that for?!

12:35.140 --> 12:37.160
It's a Beastman's good luck salute.

12:37.160 --> 12:39.480
I don't need that. This'll be an easy win!

12:39.760 --> 12:43.490
The match ends when one fighter can 
no longer fight, or surrenders!

12:43.490 --> 12:47.460
Place pride in your fists!
Ready yourselves for battle!

12:47.460 --> 12:52.410
Now, the battle for the right to 
marry my daughter Roa Leonaire...

12:54.730 --> 12:55.750
will begin!

12:58.220 --> 12:59.670
Too slow!

13:02.840 --> 13:04.720
You're faster than I expected.

13:08.800 --> 13:10.850
Got you! Flying Claw!

13:12.170 --> 13:13.100
There.

13:19.900 --> 13:22.960
Come on, show me your full power already.

13:22.960 --> 13:25.290
What's the point in dilly-dallying?

13:26.490 --> 13:28.680
You will regret this!

13:28.680 --> 13:29.830
Beast Transformation!

13:39.170 --> 13:41.150
Setsu, don't let your guard down!

13:41.150 --> 13:44.800
Rouga's transformed form makes him several 
times stronger than his previous—

13:44.800 --> 13:48.550
And... Bam!

13:56.430 --> 13:58.900
Seriously?! He's destroying him!

13:58.900 --> 14:01.900
Overwhelming Rouga so easily 
after he transformed...

14:05.960 --> 14:07.460
Wow...

14:07.460 --> 14:10.630
Awesome! Setsu, you're the best!

14:10.630 --> 14:12.160
I love you!

14:12.160 --> 14:15.370
Even with a different look,
you're still the best!

14:15.370 --> 14:17.480
Isn't that enough, Regulus?

14:15.370 --> 14:17.480
Future master, you're awesome!

14:17.480 --> 14:19.870
There's no point in going any further!

14:17.480 --> 14:19.870
I'll buy you dinner later!

14:19.870 --> 14:23.500
Marriage aside, just let 
me borrow Roa for now!

14:19.870 --> 14:23.500
So awesome! So great!

14:24.380 --> 14:26.490
Enough of your nonsense!

14:26.490 --> 14:28.010
This isn't over—

14:28.010 --> 14:32.130
I don't want to hurt your 
Beastman pride any more.

14:32.130 --> 14:33.100
Know when to quit.

14:37.130 --> 14:41.860
I'm not even worthy of being 
defeated by you? Is that it?

14:48.310 --> 14:49.820
<i>Is it despair?</i>

14:51.040 --> 14:54.330
<i>Is it jealousy of a superior being?</i>

14:56.090 --> 14:59.140
I... I'm...

14:59.140 --> 15:02.830
<i>Is it hatred of your powerless self?</i>

15:06.960 --> 15:10.620
Take this!

15:07.550 --> 15:10.620
Good. You've got guts!

15:11.010 --> 15:11.870
There!

15:15.300 --> 15:16.210
This isn't over!

15:16.210 --> 15:17.470
Come on, bring it!

15:22.000 --> 15:26.230
I am... I am...

15:26.230 --> 15:28.910
There's something wrong with his opponent!

15:28.910 --> 15:30.780
This bad feeling...

15:30.780 --> 15:38.410
I cannot... ever... allow myself to lose!

15:42.540 --> 15:44.040
What is this power?!

15:52.620 --> 15:54.510
That's Toma's curse!

15:54.970 --> 15:56.390
Setsu! Watch out!

16:02.690 --> 16:05.520
No! Evacuate the audience!

16:05.830 --> 16:07.750
That's some incredible power.

16:07.750 --> 16:10.650
But gaining so much strength 
from a curse would surely...

16:10.650 --> 16:12.900
Setsu! Use this!

16:22.270 --> 16:25.520
Kill! Kill Setsu!

16:29.120 --> 16:31.090
I need to settle him down!

16:41.020 --> 16:43.810
Damn it! He can regenerate, too?!

16:44.180 --> 16:47.400
Rouga! The duel is canceled! Stop it!

16:47.400 --> 16:50.010
Die! Everyone die!

16:50.010 --> 16:50.820
Watch out!

16:52.160 --> 16:53.780
Don't be so careless!

16:54.200 --> 16:55.810
That curse could transmit to you!

16:58.020 --> 17:02.180
Then the least I can do is finish him myself,
as a proud Beastman warrior!

17:02.180 --> 17:05.560
No, he's just temporarily being 
controlled by the curse.

17:05.560 --> 17:07.040
I don't want him to die!

17:07.380 --> 17:09.310
You have a plan?

17:09.310 --> 17:14.050
Yeah. But it's a big risk, 
given the strength of the curse.

17:14.050 --> 17:17.530
I'll be defenseless while I do it, so...

17:17.530 --> 17:20.650
No problem. I'll protect you, no matter what.

17:22.350 --> 17:23.890
Arise, Glutton!

17:24.410 --> 17:26.620
Devour this curse!

17:28.640 --> 17:33.400
Oh, no! I can't let this weakling bother Setsu.

17:35.500 --> 17:40.410
Roa-san... Roa-san!

17:42.350 --> 17:46.410
Long time no see, Setsu. I missed you.

17:46.410 --> 17:49.000
Toma, you...

17:49.640 --> 17:51.360
Are you mad?

17:51.360 --> 17:56.010
I had to stop him. He was going to make 
you waste your precious magic power.

17:56.480 --> 18:02.380
I'm sorry. I should come see you in person, 
but I can't go there right now.

18:02.380 --> 18:08.020
I always believed you'd come back, 
so I'm glad to see you again.

18:08.480 --> 18:11.790
Was it you?! Did you trick
Rouga into doing this?!

18:11.790 --> 18:16.150
Stop, Roa! Don't approach Toma,
even if he's an illusion!

18:17.200 --> 18:19.280
Filthy female.

18:19.280 --> 18:22.160
Don't interrupt my conversation with Setsu.

18:25.420 --> 18:26.810
Stop, Toma!

18:26.810 --> 18:29.860
Oh, so you'll do that?

18:29.860 --> 18:34.380
You'll point your sword at me 
for some lowly female Beastman?

18:37.480 --> 18:41.400
Again, you'll protect 
someone other than me, huh?

18:41.400 --> 18:47.180
You promised! Yet it's always someone else!

18:48.620 --> 18:53.670
Fine, then. Even so, I'll make you happy, Setsu!

18:53.670 --> 18:57.330
I'm the only one who can make you happy!

18:57.910 --> 19:05.740
All the unnecessary stuff—humans, demons, 
Beastmen—I'll kill them all for you!

19:06.020 --> 19:08.750
Once the whole world is tidied up,

19:08.750 --> 19:12.750
Setsu and I will live a quiet life as gods!

19:13.040 --> 19:15.170
Sounds wonderful, right?

19:16.150 --> 19:18.240
Cut it out, you yandere idiot!

19:19.120 --> 19:22.360
I don't care what you have planned.

19:22.360 --> 19:25.140
If you're gonna hurt innocents...

19:25.140 --> 19:27.640
I'll cut you down again.

19:29.150 --> 19:31.660
You really are pointing your sword at me.

19:32.160 --> 19:36.650
Yeah, I guess that's how 
"Everyone's Hero" should behave.

19:39.640 --> 19:43.240
Distinia's invasion of the 
demonic continent has begun.

19:43.240 --> 19:47.290
The world has been set in motion.
Can you make it here in time from there?

19:47.740 --> 19:51.290
Can you protect everyone, "Hero" Setsu?

19:52.830 --> 19:56.570
I'm glad you're well, Setsu.

19:56.570 --> 20:00.550
I'll finally win you over this time.

20:33.860 --> 20:35.750
I'm sorry.

20:36.080 --> 20:39.100
I shouldn't have approved this duel...

20:39.100 --> 20:41.130
It's not your fault.

20:41.130 --> 20:43.940
But we can get sentimental later.

20:43.940 --> 20:46.300
Now isn't the time to sulk.

20:47.120 --> 20:49.010
Yes, you're right.

20:49.360 --> 20:53.140
We'll head over to the demonic 
continent right away to stop Toma.

20:53.390 --> 20:56.700
Right. I'll arrange a ship for you right away.

20:56.700 --> 21:00.650
Our Zoo Dorado army will make preparations
and follow as soon as possible.

21:00.650 --> 21:03.570
Yeah. I'm counting on you!

21:21.220 --> 21:22.970
Are you all right, Roa?

21:25.200 --> 21:27.550
Who do you think you're asking? Of course I am.

21:32.530 --> 21:34.590
We can get sentimental later.

21:34.590 --> 21:37.060
We have things to take care of.

21:38.480 --> 21:40.400
Yeah, you're right.

21:52.400 --> 21:54.280
Watch me, Rouga.

23:27.000 --> 23:32.010
<b><i>Next Time</i></b>

23:27.000 --> 23:32.010
<b><i>Summoned to Another World for the First Time</i></b>

23:27.700 --> 23:31.110
Next time: "Summoned to Another 
World for the First Time."
